.TH start-cli-package-select-dependency-provider 1  "select-dependency-provider "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-package\-select\-dependency\-provider \- Select or clear a dependency provider
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli package select\-dependency\-provider\fR [\fB\-\-provider\-id\fR] [\fB\-\-locked\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIID\fR> <\fIDEPENDENCY_ID\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Select or clear a dependency provider
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-provider\-id\fR \fI<PROVIDER_ID>\fR
Physical provider package identifier; omit to clear the preference
.TP
\fB\-\-locked\fR
Lock the selected provider without automatic fallback
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIID\fR>
Package identifier
.TP
<\fIDEPENDENCY_ID\fR>
Logical dependency package identifier
